  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong>Discord<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8nahPuvkqx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/8nahPuvkqx</a><br><span style=\"color:#169179\">Twitter(X)<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fTehen4649\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Tehen4649</a><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube<br><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TEHEN_4649/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@TEHEN_4649/videos</a></span></span><br><br>英文</strong></span></h1>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>禁止未經許可存取或提取內部資料<br><br></strong></span></h1>\n<h3><br><strong>音效提供：<br>・<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundeffect-lab.info%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundeffect-lab.info/</a><br>・</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fotologic.jp%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://otologic.jp/</a></strong></h3>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h2><strong>{所需模組}</strong></h2>\n<p>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files/4587214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Player Animator</strong></a></p>\n<p>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>{概述}</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>[預設按鍵設定]</strong></p>\n<p><strong>N</strong>: 啟動技能</p>\n<p><strong>R</strong>: 切換技能</p>\n<p><strong>H</strong>: 使用反轉術式（需滿足條件）<br><br><strong>J</strong>: 使用簡易領域（需滿足條件）</p>\n<p><strong>V + (A or D)</strong>: 閃避</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【指令與遊戲規則】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>/setplayerlevel [Player name] [0~100]</strong></p>\n<p>變更指定玩家的等級。</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule onlymodentityspawn&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>: 僅會生成模組角色</p>\n<p><strong>false</strong>: 也會生成原版生物</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule lockplayerlevel</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>: 玩家等級將不再變動</p>\n<p><strong>false</strong>: 玩家等級將正常變動</p>\n<p>【玩家等級】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_4e9a0b66-d5b2-4101-8de3-a04c92056932.png\" width=\"342\" height=\"229\"><br><br></p>\n<p>物品欄介面會顯示玩家等級及升級所需的經驗值數量。<br>隨著玩家等級提升，其屬性也會隨之增加。</p>\n<p>擊敗敵人、觸發黑閃以及完成任務均可獲得經驗值。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_b04236c0-2ced-44d0-88cc-8c9379bf5aec.png\"><br><em>此經驗值與原版經驗值獨立計算。</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br>【特殊技能】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_65bb767e-a723-4545-9e6c-67abed1826cc.png\" width=\"298\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p>消耗畫面左上角顯示的計量表即可發動特殊技能。<br>消耗特殊計量表的技能名稱會呈現紫色發光效果。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_ce9472b7-04ab-4753-817c-7d06bfcb63e8.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>【任務】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_2d0c82b0-d6f2-4e77-89f7-9059dc649356.png\" width=\"111\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p>使用道具<strong>&ldquo;任務書&rdquo;</strong>即可開始任務。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_bc2987c0-b7c8-49ab-986c-b961efc4c52f.png\"></p>\n<div>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><em>等級達 10 級以上方可挑戰任務。</em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<p>【建築結構】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_62aa1bbc-5e8a-458c-bf9f-610391b06c18.png\"></p>\n<p>現在將生成新的建築結構。<br>這些結構中偶爾會包含稀有寶箱。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_661ee932-89f3-414a-a6dd-5784f6e73f7b.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>*若技能名稱未顯示，請嘗試降低 Forge 版本，並避免使用地圖顯示模組或疊加層模組進行遊戲。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">日文<br><br></span></strong></h1>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">禁止未經許可存取或提取內部資料</span></strong></h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n</article>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>｛前置模組｝</strong></h2>\n<h3>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files/4587214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Player animator</strong></span></a></h3>\n<h3>・<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></span></a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;{概述}</strong></h2>\n<h4>【按鍵設定】※預設</h4>\n<p><strong>N 啟動技能</strong></p>\n<p><strong>R 切換技能</strong></p>\n<p><strong>H 使用反轉術式（需滿足條件）<br><br>J 使用簡易領域（需滿足條件）<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>V+(A 或 D) 閃避</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>【指令與遊戲規則】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>/setplayerlevel [玩家名稱] [0~100]</strong></p>\n<p>可變更指定玩家的等級。</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule onlymodentityspawn&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>：僅會生成模組角色</p>\n<p><strong>false</strong>：也會生成原版生物</p>\n<p><strong>/gamerule lockplayerlevel</strong></p>\n<p><strong>true</strong>：玩家等級將不再變動</p>\n<p><strong>false：</strong>玩家等級將正常變動</p>\n<p>【玩家等級】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_4e9a0b66-d5b2-4101-8de3-a04c92056932.png\" width=\"342\" height=\"229\"><br><br></p>\n<p>物品欄介面會顯示<strong>玩家等級</strong>及<strong>升級所需的經驗值數量</strong>。<br>隨著等級提升，玩家屬性也會隨之增加。</p>\n<p>透過<strong>擊敗敵人</strong>、<strong>觸發黑閃</strong>、<strong>完成任務</strong>即可獲得經驗值。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_b04236c0-2ced-44d0-88cc-8c9379bf5aec.png\"><br>※此經驗值與原版經驗值獨立計算</p>\n<hr>\n<p><br>【特殊技能】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_65bb767e-a723-4545-9e6c-67abed1826cc.png\" width=\"298\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p>消耗畫面左上角顯示的計量表即可發動特殊技能。<br>消耗特殊計量表的技能名稱會呈現紫色發光效果。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_ce9472b7-04ab-4753-817c-7d06bfcb63e8.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>【任務】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_2d0c82b0-d6f2-4e77-89f7-9059dc649356.png\" width=\"111\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p>使用道具「任務書」即可開始任務</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_bc2987c0-b7c8-49ab-986c-b961efc4c52f.png\"></p>\n<p>※等級達 10 級以上方可挑戰任務</p>\n<hr>\n<p>【建築結構】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_62aa1bbc-5e8a-458c-bf9f-610391b06c18.png\"></p>\n<p>現在將生成新的建築結構。<br>這些結構中偶爾會包含稀有寶箱。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269804/description_661ee932-89f3-414a-a6dd-5784f6e73f7b.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br><strong>※若技能名稱未顯示，請嘗試降低 Forge 版本，並避免使用地圖顯示模組或疊加層模組進行遊戲</strong></p>",
